            "The denominator includes every expected charge; unaligned actual charges remain explicit. This helper does not mutate quotations or historical metrics."
          ]
        },
        "limitations": [
          "This separate v4 gate preserves historical metric values and fixed expected denominators, including missing rows and uncited fields. Its charge alignment differs from older positional gates; results across gate versions are not interchangeable.",
          "Identifier alignment is necessary, not sufficient: every annotated critical stated item field must also be correct and source-linked.",
          "Charges require mutually unique kind, application, currency, billing-period and amount-location alignment before field scoring. Item-scoped charges also require the independently scored item mapping. Array order and equal amounts do not establish identity.",
